# Only `www/` and `nginx.conf` are needed to build the image (see Dockerfile).
# Everything else is excluded so it is not sent to the Docker build context.
# This drops ~200K of `.git` history (~66% of the context) plus docs/CI config,
# making context upload faster and avoiding spurious layer-cache invalidation.
.git
.github
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
northflank.json
README.md
LICENSE
